WeylScal4: treat Psi1 and Psi3 as scalars so that Cartoon2D accepts them
========================================================================
Cartoon2D aborts on the ManualCartesian tensor type of the Psi1 and Psi3
groups ("Illegal tensor type alias for group WEYLSCAL4::PSI1R_GROUP").
Cartoon2D only rotates about the z axis, and in an axisymmetric
spacetime WeylScal4's tetrad rotates with the point, so every Psi_n is a
scalar under those rotations. The z reflection parities of the original
tags are kept: Re Psi1 and Re Psi3 are odd ("++-"), Im Psi1 and Im Psi3
even ("--+"); a Scalar's tensorparity applies to every reflection, and
the x and y reflections are not in use with Cartoon2D. The invariants I
and J, which this project uses, are computed pointwise from the Psi_n
and are unaffected by how the ghost zones of the Psi_n are filled.

Applied to the Cactus tree by scripts/apply_cactus_patches.sh.

--- a/arrangements/EinsteinAnalysis/WeylScal4/interface.ccl
+++ b/arrangements/EinsteinAnalysis/WeylScal4/interface.ccl
@@ -57,13 +57,13 @@
 } "Psi0i_group"
 
 public:
-CCTK_REAL Psi1r_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="ManualCartesian" tensorweight=0 cartesianreflectionparities="++-"'
+CCTK_REAL Psi1r_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="Scalar" tensorweight=0 tensorparity=-1'
 {
   Psi1r
 } "Psi1r_group"
 
 public:
-CCTK_REAL Psi1i_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="ManualCartesian" tensorweight=0 cartesianreflectionparities="--+"'
+CCTK_REAL Psi1i_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="Scalar" tensorweight=0 tensorparity=1'
 {
   Psi1i
 } "Psi1i_group"
@@ -81,13 +81,13 @@
 } "Psi2i_group"
 
 public:
-CCTK_REAL Psi3r_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="ManualCartesian" tensorweight=0 cartesianreflectionparities="++-"'
+CCTK_REAL Psi3r_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="Scalar" tensorweight=0 tensorparity=-1'
 {
   Psi3r
 } "Psi3r_group"
 
 public:
-CCTK_REAL Psi3i_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="ManualCartesian" tensorweight=0 cartesianreflectionparities="--+"'
+CCTK_REAL Psi3i_group type=GF timelevels=3 tags='tensortypealias="Scalar" tensorweight=0 tensorparity=1'
 {
   Psi3i
 } "Psi3i_group"
